      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=EX2-056#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for EX2-056 (Mar. 28, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes. This card's effect reads \"when [...] would digivolve into,\" so the effect interrupts the digivolution when it activates. Therefore, it activates first and gives that Digimon ＜Blitz＞ even if the digivolution later fails.",
        "question": "When one of my Digimon would digivolve into a Digimon with [Gallantmon], if I can no longer pay the digivolution cost due to the inherited effect on my opponent's [EX3-016 SnowAgumon] or [EX3-019 Paledramon] and the digivolution fails, does the Digimon from the attempted digivolution still gain the [When Digivolving] ＜Blitz＞ effect from this card's effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
